Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Value-added model coding question (based on Mariano, McCaffrey, and Lockwood 2010)
Message-ID: <N_Dqmfwhmu4.1XXOUDKzAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <N_Dqmfwhmu4.POyPgT2ZAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
