Guido,

The point is that such a transformation could be implemented as

parameters {
  real<lower=0, upper=0.5 * pi()> alpha_tilde;
  …
}

model {
  …
  alpha <- location + scale * alpha_tilde;
  …
}

No uniform is necessary once alpha_tilde is properly constrained.

