Subject: priors for scales/variances/precisions? need Wiki update
Message-ID: <AqBZT2h5Jyw.d--fr6K1BAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <AqBZT2h5Jyw.Tsu15OizBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <AqBZT2h5Jyw.psetzWVfBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <AqBZT2h5Jyw.Tsu15OizBAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
