Andrew's approach sounds like (model) stacking from the machine
learning literature.

See, e.g., Leo Brieman, "Stacked Regression". Machine Learning 24(1),
pp. 49-64 (July 1996) or Section 8.8 of the Elements of Statistical
Learning by Hastie, Tibshirani, and Friedman (free PDF available on
Tibshirani's website).

