From ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com  Mon Feb  8 04:14:32 2016
From: ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com (Michael Betancourt)
Date: Mon, 08 Feb 2016 04:14:32 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Bayesian model averaging without reversible-jump MCMC on highly-dimensional models
Message-ID: <ixBFDRJj8Y0.eSZbv2m6AAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ixBFDRJj8Y0.z_F7bYmxAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <ixBFDRJj8Y0.Zag10wQlBQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <ixBFDRJj8Y0.z_F7bYmxAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
