Subject: Re: [stan-users] non-centered parameterisation for bounded parameters
Message-ID: <wQMDuh_hwXA.1KmpEGdBAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <wQMDuh_hwXA.NjsYjRDbAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
