Subject: Re: [stan-users] How to deal with the variance if it is a matrix in pmf model?
Message-ID: <4xZJmyrXYxI.IkFvAcOAAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <4xZJmyrXYxI.IuySQdt0AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <4xZJmyrXYxI.IuySQdt0AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
