MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi Kevin, like you said the total elpd is the sum of the individual contributions. The standard error we use in the loo package is just sqrt(N * var(elpd)).

