> I have gotten the program(s) to run.
> I have not and can not share the Stan program. Maybe I'll give some example code though.
> I'm using g++ 4.2 and clang++ on a mac with Yosemite 10.10.2.
>
> Running the model takes a few hours, and with this compilation time I'm getting worried about how it will scale since I have plans on building much bigger models.
> I have how ever not tried changing the compiler optimization flags and will take a look at that as soon as possible.
>
> Anyway thanks for the replies guys :)
> -Jökull
