Subject: Re: [stan-users] Error with neg_binomial_2_log_rng
Message-ID: <4g2hbwtRELQ.Korg3aYZAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <4g2hbwtRELQ.tptdZX0JAQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
