From uda33143a8db60ce8 at groups.google.com  Wed Feb 24 00:51:42 2016
From: uda33143a8db60ce8 at groups.google.com (Andrew Gelman)
Date: Wed, 24 Feb 2016 00:51:42 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] PSIS-LOO for trial-by-trial modeling
Message-ID: <kew2-ODKYwQ.dOUvBX90AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <kew2-ODKYwQ.mYmsZA4XFQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
