I am wondering if there is any way in Stan to avoid storing samples of variables defined in modified parameters (or more generally, to select a subset of variables for storage). I am in a scenario where these extra samples are not needed, but take up a lot of RAM.

From ufc5d3270037d7478 at groups.google.com  Sun Feb 28 23:00:18 2016
From: ufc5d3270037d7478 at groups.google.com (Jonah Gabry)
